-- Purpose: {what question this query answers}
-- Grain: {one row per what}
-- Date window: {exact filter applied, if any — e.g. >= '{date_from}' AND < '{date_to}'}
-- Joins/assumptions: {any non-obvious join choice or exclusion, and why}
